# Where the early-access form POSTs its JSON ({ email, shop, artists }).
# Formspree: create a form at https://formspree.io and paste its endpoint, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
# Leave empty during development: the form will validate and show the success state without sending.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are baked in at build time, so rebuild/redeploy after changing it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WAITLIST_ENDPOINT=
